le_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123504004:1":{"text":"ここがわしのいるべき場所じゃよ。わしはここで砂漠の白骨となるのじゃ。","source_cn":"我已经回到自己所属之地，并将化为沙漠中的白骨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1738DB7D5AC03632","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1123504005:1":{"text":"ここはいい。この場所には鋼顎獣の骨が埋まっておるでな。わしの終着点にぴったりではないか。","source_cn":"我很中意这里。这里曾有只钢颚兽并埋骨于此，多么相称的终途。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA70B943A627FE770","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1123504005":{"text":"ここはいい。この場所には鋼顎獣の骨が埋まっておるでな。わしの終着点にぴったりではないか。","source_cn":"我很中意这里。这里曾有只钢颚兽并埋骨于此，多么相称的终途。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA70B943A627FE770","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1123504006:1":{"text":"それはお前が決めることではないぞ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>よ。","source_cn":"你不能对此定义，<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBBB62FF3135D319C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"それはお前が決めることではないぞ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>よ。","female":"それはお前が決めることではないぞ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>よ。","variant_male_record_index":"126200","variant_female_record_index":"126201","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123504007:1":{"text":"いや、<s